.SH NAME
md_CHANGELOG \- 📝 SystemEx Changelog 
.PP

.SH "⭐ [0\&.95\&.6023-rc4] 08\&.10\&.2026 — internal Preview for 1\&.0 → Lacking"
.PP
.SS "Added"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fREmpty\fP:
.IP "  \(bu" 4
Represents a reusable empty-value marker type for generic APIs and result pipelines\&.
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRTimeout<T>\fP: Provides a generic timeout abstraction with support for finite and infinite timeout values\&. Includes helper utilities for timeout validation and timeout-state checks\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRReference\fP: Provides a base class for reference-counted objects\&. Supports deterministic lifetime tracking through explicit reference management\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRThreadSafeIndex\fP: Provides an atomic thread-safe index helper for concurrent container and synchronization scenarios\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added cache-backed stack support: Introduced stack operations for reference-based cache implementations\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRModulePreloader\fP: Provides preloading support for native modules before runtime invocation\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRFunction<TReturn, TDelegate>\fP: Strongly typed wrapper around native function bindings and delegate-based invocation\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added debug metadata support to \fRIValueReader\fP implementations: Read operations can now expose additional diagnostic metadata for debugging and inspection\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added utility helpers for \fRTriple<T>\fP: Additional logical and comparison helper functions (\fRAnd\fP, \fROr\fP, comparison helpers, and related utilities)\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fR\fBVersion\&.cs\fP\fP: Represents a mutable version identifier with major, minor, and build components and additional build metadata\&. 
.PP
.SS "Changed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRCompareResult\fP was moved to the root namespace \fR\fBSystemEx\fP\fP\&. Simplifies discoverability and reduces unnecessary namespace dependencies\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRRCUHistory\fP now uses \fRByteIndex\fP addressing internally\&. Improves consistency with the cache and memory subsystem\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRResult\fP can now contain and aggregate other \fRResult\fP instances\&. Enables hierarchical result composition and nested processing pipelines\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Updated operator support across several utility and value types\&. Improved consistency of arithmetic and comparison semantics\&.
.PP
.SS "Improved"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Improved \fREpoch\fP: Added \fRGetHashCode()\fP implementation\&. Added \fRoperator true\fP and \fRoperator false\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixed epoch evaluation and RCU validation logic\&. Resolved several issues affecting RCU state checks and epoch handling\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Updated XML documentation and inline comments across the framework\&.
.PP
.SS "Removed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Removed the legacy node system\&. Preparation for a redesigned node architecture, in Future version I will added a new version, sry
.PP
.SS "Build"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added build and repository maintenance infrastructure\&.
.IP "  \(bu" 4
Added build configuration files\&.
.IP "  \(bu" 4
Updated push automation scripts\&.
.IP "  \(bu" 4
Updated repository ignore rules (\fR\&.gitignore\fP) for build artifacts and generated files\&.
.PP

.PP
.SS "Fixed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixed various bugs across \fRResult\fP, \fRResultBuilder\fP, \fRBigDecimal\fP, and the RCU subsystem\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Corrected exponent conversion issues in \fRBigDecimal\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixed assertion indexing issues in \fRResult\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Improved stability of fluent result-building operations\&.
.PP

