.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fR\fBSystemEx\&.Numeric\&.Ratio\fP\fP: Represents a rational number using a signed 64‑bit numerator and denominator\&. A Ratio stores an exact fractional value without automatic reduction\&. This allows the representation of structural fractions such as gear ratios\&.
