.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRSystemEx\&.MathR\fP for Ratio Math Utils with:
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRPow\fP: Raises a ratio to an integer power exactly\&.
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRDegreesToRadians\fP: Converts degrees to radians\&.
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRRadiansToDegrees\fP: Converts radians to degrees\&.
.IP "  \(bu" 4
