.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRMin\fP, \fRMax\fP, \fRMinMax\fP:
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRSqrt\fP with new return Type Result: Computes the square root of a \fR\fBSystemEx\&.Numeric\&.Ratio\fP\fP and returns the result inside a \fR\fBSystemEx\&.Result\fP\fP object\&. The method distinguishes between rational and irrational square roots\&.
.PP

