.SH "[0\&.70\&.658] 30\&.07\&.2026 -> Lacking"
.PP
.SS "Added"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRSafeCounter\fP with operator suite (++, --, +, -, ==, !=) with full atomic semantics\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added new Interrfaces \fRISpinlock<T>\fP, \fRILock<T>\fP and \fRILock\fP : unified locking abstraction for atomic and OS‑level synchronization\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added new Light atomic based Locks based on \fRILock<T>\fP and SafeCounter:
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRLightCountingSpinlock<T>\fP: atomic multi‑capacity spinlock with deterministic decrement/increment semantics\&.
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRLightMutex<T>\fP based on \fRLightCountingSpinlock<T>\fP: binary spinlock with strict owner‑tracking built on top of LightCountingSpinlock<T>\&.
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRMutexLock\fP OS‑level blocking mutex wrapper; kernel‑managed, not interchangeable with atomic spinlock‑based locks\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRSpinlock\fP thin wrapper around System\&.Threading\&.SpinLock exposing a busy‑wait mutual exclusion primitive via \fRISpinlock<T>\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added new Iterrator System for IContainerEx System, the old in SystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.Interfaces are Obsolete and remove in version 1\&.0
.IP "  \(bu" 4
Added a \fRRandomAccessIterator<T, Array<T>> Begin\fP, \fRRandomAccessIterator<T, Array<T>> End\fP, \fRRandomAccessIterator<T, Array<T>> ReverseBegin\fP and \fRRandomAccessIterator<T, Array<T>> ReverseEnd\fP to \fRArray<T>\fP and \fRVector<T>\fP Objects
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
Added to \fRSortActions \fP helper: simple heap‑based min/max sort placing minimum at the start and maximum at the end\&.
.PP
.SS "Added – SystemEx\&.AI"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Introduced the \fR\fBSystemEx\&.AI\fP\fP subsystem, providing a unified abstraction layer for AI model invocation within \fBSystemEx\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRModel<TPrompt, TResult>\fP as the base contract for all AI models, defining prompt handling, backend routing, configuration management, and result processing\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRIModelBackend<T>\fP to standardize backend communication, including request construction, parameter merging, and transport‑agnostic execution\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRWebAIBackend<T>\fP implementing \fRIModelBackend<T>\fP for HTTP‑based AI endpoints (e\&.g\&., OpenAI‑compatible APIs)\&. Supports configurable model selection, streaming, response formatting, and backend‑specific parameters\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRModelPromp<T>\fP and \fRModelResult<T>\fP to formalize prompt input and result output, including context propagation, metadata, and optional session identifiers\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRWebAIModel\fP, a lightweight front‑facing wrapper around \fRWebAIBackend<T>\fP, providing model switching, configuration helpers (temperature, top‑p, max‑tokens, response‑format), and simplified usage for applications\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
The subsystem is backend‑agnostic and allows future integration of additional AI backends (local inference, custom gateways, etc\&.) without modifying model‑level code\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added \fRExample/AI/\fP directory containing a minimal working example (\fRMain\&.cs\fP) and bilingual documentation (\fRREADME\&.en\&.md\fP, \fRREADME\&.de\&.md\fP) demonstrating how to integrate Microsoft AITools using the \fR\fBSystemEx\&.AI\fP\fP abstraction layer\&.
.PP
.SS "Changed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Renamed \fRSimpleThread\fP → \fRLightThread\fP for naming consistency\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Renamed \fRSimpleConditionVariable\fP → \fRLightConditionVariable\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRDequeue<T>\fP is now auto‑growable and includes new utility functions\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRMap\fP addes more functions: TryGet, GetOrDefault , add Erase anbd Remove functions
.PP
.SS "Note"
This release contains several internal adjustments required for the ongoing integration of \fR\fBSystemEx\&.AI\fP\fP\&. 
.br
 Some components have been temporarily simplified or restructured and will be restored or finalized in upcoming versions once the new architecture is fully consolidated\&. 
.br
 The public API remains stable; only internal behavior may differ slightly until the next release\&.

.PP
