.SH "[0\&.8\&.5] 04\&.06\&.2026"
.PP
.SS "Very Important"
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRMajor namespace restructuring\fP to reflect the engine architecture and clarify responsibilities across collections, device memory, and interop layers\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
This release contains \fRbreaking changes\fP: update all \fRusing\fP/imports to the new namespaces\&.
.PP
.SS "Changed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Moved device memory types (\fRDeviceBuffer\fP, \fRDeviceSharedBuffer<TDeviceSharedBackend>\fP) to \fR\fBSystemEx\&.Device\&.Memory\fP\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Moved native interop and backend implementations (\fRUnmanagedObject\fP, \fRRamSharedBackend\fP, \fRIDeviceSharedBackend\fP, platform kernel loaders) to \fRSystemEx\&.Device\&.Interop\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Kept kernel and execution interfaces (\fRIKernel<TBackend>\fP, \fRRamKernel\fP, kernel lifecycle orchestration) under \fR\fBSystemEx\&.Device\fP\fP\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Removed legacy \fRSystemEx\&.Device\&.Memory\&.Missings\fP layout and deprecated \fRSystem\&.Memory\&.Missings\fP placements; types have been relocated to the new namespaces above\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Updated internal references and XML docs to reflect new namespace locations\&.
.PP
.SS "Added"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Migration guidance notes and quick reference mapping for common types:
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRSystemEx\&.Device\&.Memory\&.Missings\&.RamSharedBackend\fP → \fRSystemEx\&.Device\&.Interop\&.RamSharedBackend\fP
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRSystemEx\&.Device\&.Memory\&.DeviceSharedBuffer\fP → \fRSystemEx\&.Device\&.Memory\&.DeviceSharedBuffer\fP
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRSystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.SharedCache\fP → \fR\fBSystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.Cache\fP\fP (and related cache types)
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
Add a Map for ITuples \fRSystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.TupleMap\fP, \fRSystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.MultiTupleMap\fP and \fRSystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.SortedTupleMap\fP
.IP "\(bu" 2
Add \fR\fBSystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\&.StrippedCache\fP\fP (segmented virtual cache over N sub‑caches; global addressing, byte‑wise distribution)\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Added full support for:
.IP "  \(bu" 4
WriteRange(ulong position, byte[] data)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
WriteRange(ulong start, ulong end, byte[] data)
.IP "  \(bu" 4
ToArray(int index) for exporting individual cache segments\&.
.IP "  \(bu" 4
Added unsigned‑safe global addressing logic for multi‑cache memory systems\&.
.IP "  \(bu" 4
Added overflow‑safe Seek logic compatible with segmented caches\&.
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
Add \fRSystemEx\&.Collection\&.Generic\&.MirroredCache\fP (dual‑cache pair; writes to A and mirrored A‑reverse; consistent read/write symmetry)\&.
.PP
.SS "Improved"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Clear separation of concerns between collection‑level caches and device‑level memory/backends\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Improved discoverability and consistency for public APIs across Collections, Device, and Interop subsystems\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Simplified developer mental model for where to place new types: Collections for logical cache/data structures; Device\&.Memory for managed device memory abstractions; Device\&.Interop for native/backends\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Improved Seek implementation to be fully ulong‑safe and handle negative offsets without overflow\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Improved internal consistency between Cache and StrippedCache semantics (global vs\&. local addressing)\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Improved index validation for segmented cache exports (ToArray(index))\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2

.PP
.SS "Fixed"
.IP "\(bu" 2
Resolved ambiguous type collisions caused by previous overlapping namespaces\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixed incorrect index comparison in ToArray(int index) (unsigned‑correct boundary check)\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixed potential overflow in SeekOrigin\&.Current and SeekOrigin\&.End when negative offsets were cast to ulong\&.
.IP "\(bu" 2
Fixed incorrect cast from ulong to long in cache index validation\&. 
.PP
.SS "Notes / Migration"
.IP "\(bu" 2
\fRBreaking change:\fP update all \fRusing\fP directives and project references to the new namespaces\&. 
.br
 Example mappings:
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRusing SystemEx\&.Device\&.Memory\&.Missings;\fP → \fRusing \fBSystemEx\&.Device\&.Memory\fP;\fP
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRusing SystemEx\&.Collection\&.Generic;\fP (old cache location) → \fRusing \fBSystemEx\&.Collections\&.Generic\fP;\fP
.IP "  \(bu" 4
\fRusing \fBSystemEx\&.Device\&.Intertropt\fP;\fP → \fRusing SystemEx\&.Device\&.Interop;\fP
.PP

.IP "\(bu" 2
Search your codebase for the old namespace tokens (\fRMissings\fP, \fRIntertropt\fP, \fRSystem\&.Memory\&.Missings\fP) and replace with the new targets\&.
.PP

